#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:439
msgid "Santa María Key"
msgstr "Cayo Santa María"

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:440
msgid ""
"This key offers pristine white-sand beaches and crystal-clear waters, "
"connected by a causeway to the main island, ideal for relaxing and enjoying "
"nature."
msgstr ""

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:455
msgid "Cayo Coco and Cayo Guillermo"
msgstr "Cayo Coco y Cayo Guillermo"

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:456
msgid ""
"Destinations with white sand beaches and crystal-clear waters, perfect for "
"snorkeling, diving, and birdwatching in a protected natural environment."
msgstr ""
"Destinos con playas de arena blanca y aguas cristalinas, perfectos para "
"snorkel, buceo y observación de aves en un entorno natural protegido."

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:471
msgid "Paradise Beach (Key Largo)"
msgstr "Playa Paraíso (Cayo Largo)"

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:472
msgid ""
"Considered one of the most beautiful beaches in the world, it offers a "
"tranquil setting with crystal-clear waters and fine sand, ideal for relaxing."
msgstr ""
"Considerada una de las playas más hermosas del mundo, ofrece un entorno "
"tranquilo con aguas cristalinas y arena fina, ideal para desconectar."

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:486
msgid "Ancón Beach"
msgstr "Playa Ancón"

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:487
msgid ""
"Located near Trinidad, it combines beach and colonial culture, making it an "
"excellent place for diving and exploring local history."
msgstr ""
"Ubicada cerca de Trinidad, combina playa y cultura colonial, es un excelente "
"lugar para bucear y disfrutar de la historia local."

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:503
msgid ""
"A national park with unique karst formations, declared a World Heritage "
"Site, ideal for hiking, climbing, and learning about tobacco culture."
msgstr ""
"Parque Nacional con formaciones kársticas únicas, declarado Patrimonio de la "
"Humanidad, ideal para senderismo, escalada y conocer la cultura del tabaco."

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:519
msgid ""
"The first ville founded in Cuba, surrounded by mountains and rivers, famous "
"for its biodiversity and cocoa production, ideal for ecotourism."
msgstr ""
"Primera villa fundada en Cuba, rodeada de montañas y ríos, famosa por su "
"biodiversidad y producción de cacao, ideal para ecoturismo."

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:534
msgid ""
"The capital of Cuba, with a historic center declared a World Heritage Site, "
"offers colonial architecture, emblematic squares, museums, and the Malecón."
msgstr ""
"Capital de Cuba con un casco histórico declarado Patrimonio de la Humanidad, "
"ofrece arquitectura colonial, plazas emblemáticas, museos y el Malecón."

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:549
msgid ""
"A colonial city with cobblestone streets and colorful houses, a World "
"Heritage Site, with access to Ancón Beach and excellent for exploring "
"history and culture."
msgstr ""
"Ciudad colonial con calles empedradas y coloridas casas, Patrimonio de la "
"Humanidad, con acceso a Playa Ancón y excelente para explorar historia y "
"cultura."

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:564
msgid ""
"Known as the 'Pearl of the South,' it stands out for its French "
"architecture, its bay, and attractions such as José Martí Park and the "
"Palacio de Valle."
msgstr ""
"Conocida como la 'Perla del Sur', destaca por su arquitectura francesa, su "
"bahía y atractivos como el Parque José Martí y el Palacio de Valle."

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:579
msgid ""
"The cradle of the Revolution, with historic sites like Morro Castle and a "
"vibrant cultural life that reflects Cuban identity."
msgstr ""
"Cuna de la Revolución, con sitios históricos como el Castillo del Morro y "
"una vibrante vida cultural que refleja la identidad cubana."

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:594
msgid ""
"Known for Che Guevara's mausoleum, it is a historic center that offers "
"culture and revolutionary memory in a pleasant urban setting."
msgstr ""
"Conocida por el mausoleo del Che Guevara, es un centro histórico que ofrece "
"cultura y memoria revolucionaria en un entorno urbano agradable."

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:609
msgid ""
"A city with a labyrinth of streets and squares, rich in architectural and "
"cultural heritage, ideal for discovering authentic Cuba."
msgstr ""
"Ciudad con un laberinto de calles y plazas, rica en patrimonio "
"arquitectónico y cultural, ideal para descubrir la Cuba auténtica."

#: templates/landingpage/landing.html:624
msgid ""
"A major eastern city with parks and colonial architecture, known for its "
"friendly people and vibrant local culture."
msgstr ""
"Importante ciudad oriental con parques y arquitectura colonial, conocida por "
"su gente amable y su vibrante cultura local."

